    Additionally assume $R$ is local with the unique maximal ideal $\m$. Let $(\a_j)_{j\in\bbZ_+}$ be a countable sequence of nonzero ideals in $R$ such that $\sqrt{\sum_{j=1}^{\infty} \a_j}=\m$, and let $(b_j)_{j\in\bbZ_+}$ be a sequence of positive real numbers. Then the following statements are equivalent:
